[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0964","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0964.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0837","title":"Deerfield Serv-U FTP 空字节拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Deerfield Serv-U 2.5e FTP 服务器软件存在空字节处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标 FTP 服务发送大量空字节（NULL byte）数据包，触发服务处理异常导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Serv-U 2.5e 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需任何权限即可实施，但仅影响服务可用性，不涉及数据泄露或权限提升。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0837"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.227","remediation":"将 Serv-U 升级至 2.5f 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 2.5f 中修复。如无法升级，可在防火墙或网络边界限制对 FTP 服务端口（默认 21/TCP）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以降低远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/73843","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1543","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5029","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0837.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0837","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0837.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0837.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9573-p6hp-f8x3/GHSA-9573-p6hp-f8x3.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ftp_servu_dos2.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0837.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b12a3924bcdfa7af53ab2da329173ee04bf863bc/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0964.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0963","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0963.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0832","title":"htgrep 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"htgrep CGI 程序存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 hdr 参数传入目标系统上的完整文件路径名，利用该漏洞读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响部署了 htgrep CGI 程序的 Web 服务器，攻击复杂度低，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0832"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.597","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上的 htgrep CGI 脚本（通常位于 cgi-bin/htgrep），或限制其执行权限（chmod 000）。如业务必须使用，修改脚本源码对 hdr 参数做路径白名单校验，仅允许访问指定目录下的文件，并过滤 \"../\" 等目录遍历字符。建议迁移至现代替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0208.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5476","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0832.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0832","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0832.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0832.json","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/htgrep.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0832.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0963.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0962","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0962.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0831","title":"Fastream FTP++ 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fastream FTP++ 2.0 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送超长用户名触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入长度进行有效边界检查，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响系统完整性与机密性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0831"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.477","remediation":"立即停止使用 Fastream FTP++ 2.0，该产品已停止维护且厂商已不存在。建议迁移至其他活跃维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd）。如无法立即替换，可在网络防火墙或 IPS 设备上添加规则，对 FTP 登录用户名长度进行限制（建议不超过 64 字节），并限制该 FTP 服务的来源 IP 白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0109.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0831.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0831","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0831.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0831.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gxg6-6xgq-qcr9/GHSA-gxg6-6xgq-qcr9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88344/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0831.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--a7031587-8785-48c1-9db1-8a7a6b7be821.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0962.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0961","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0961.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0825","title":"Ipswitch IMail 6.00 Web Service 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 6.00 Web 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送大量包含超长 Host 头的 HTTP 连接，导致服务线程崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Ipswitch IMail 6.00 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，通过发送大量恶意构造的 HTTP 请求消耗服务器线程资源导致服务拒绝，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于可用性部分影响的中危漏洞。Ipswitch 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级到修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0825"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.720","remediation":"建议立即升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.01 或更高版本（官方已发布补丁修复长 Host 头导致的线程崩溃）。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙或 WAF 层面限制单 IP 连接数并拦截超长 Host 头（建议限制 Host 头长度 ≤ 255 字符），同时在 IMail 服务配置中降低最大并发连接数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0071.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96659012127444&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=96654521004571&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2011","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5475","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0825.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0825.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0825","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0825.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0825.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6mw4-x44p-qq9x/GHSA-6mw4-x44p-qq9x.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/imail_host_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0961.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0960","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0960.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0813","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 FTP连接强制绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本存在 FTP 连接强制绕过漏洞。由于防火墙网关在处理特定畸形 FTP 命令（如 PORT 命令）时未正确校验连接目标地址，导致攻击者可将 FTP 数据连接重定向至任意第三方服务器（FTP Bounce），从而绕过防火墙访问控制策略。此漏洞允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过发送特制的无效 FTP 命令，利用受影响的防火墙设备探测内网服务或对第三方发起匿名扫描攻击。管理员应及时升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0813"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.053","remediation":"升级 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP1 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如在旧版环境下无法升级，可在 properties 中禁用 FTP Security Server，改为纯状态检测模式处理 FTP 流量，或通过防火墙规则限制仅允许内部客户端访问外部 FTP 服务器以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#FTP_Connection","http://www.osvdb.org/4434","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5474","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0813","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0813.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vqg7-xxpq-vpw2/GHSA-vqg7-xxpq-vpw2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9b12d208-a52d-4711-b43b-e018824ba566.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0960.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0957","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0957.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0809","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 协议检查器缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1及更早版本的协议检查器中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞位于模块间通信机制的Getkey函数中。远程攻击者无需认证，可通过向目标系统发送特制的协议请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致进程异常终止并引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有部署Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1及以下版本的防火墙设备，CVSS评分5.0，属于中等危害等级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0809"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31.557","remediation":"立即升级 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Getkey 函数的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.x 系列已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至当前受支持的 Check Point Gaia OS 平台（R81 及以上版本）。短期内如无法立即升级，应在防火墙前端部署访问控制列表（ACL），限制对防火墙管理接口的网络访问，仅允许可信管理网络连接，从而降低远程攻击者触发该溢出的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Getkey_Buffer","http://www.osvdb.org/4422","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5139","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0809","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0809.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-87wr-9qwg-43mr/GHSA-87wr-9qwg-43mr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2d167103-7227-43c8-bba9-0b0ebc161700.json","https://github.c