攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的封装数据包，绕过防火墙的安全策略检查，导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0805"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31.053","remediation":"升级 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP6 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。对于无法升级的遗留系统，在防火墙上配置访问控制规则，仅允许来自可信 FWZ 客户端的加密封装包通过，并禁用不必要的 VPN 隧道封装功能作为临时缓解措施。建议迁移至 Check Point 当前受支持版本（R80 及以上）以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Retransmission_of","http://www.osvdb.org/4415","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5469","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0805","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0805.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6f6v-7779-324h/GHSA-6f6v-7779-324h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8e07e200-4159-403a-acc7-1fa243b10b7f.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--8e07e200-4159-403a-acc7-1fa243b10b7f.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0953.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0952","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0952.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0804","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本存在安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送精心构造的 TCP 分片连接请求或重新打开已关闭的 TCP 连接请求，绕过防火墙的单向连接强制检查机制，从而在未授权情况下建立反向连接，导致防火墙安全策略失效。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低，可导致信息泄露、数据篡改及权限提升等危害。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0804"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.933","remediation":"立即升级至 Check Point 当前受支持的最新版本（如 R80.x 及以上系列），旧版 4.1 已停止技术支持且不再发布安全更新。如无法升级，在防火墙上配置 TCP 分段重组规则，启用状态检测的严格模式，并设置连接超时后强制重置而非保留半开状态；同时在网络边界部署 IPS 设备，配置针对 TCP 分段绕过攻击的检测签名以阻断此类利用流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#One-way_Connection","http://www.osvdb.org/4419","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5468","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0804","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0804.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3r3-w3mg-3rp5/GHSA-p3r3-w3mg-3rp5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5e1d6bf2-fccf-4c1d-9b35-f6c00f327ea6.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0952.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0899","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0899.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0867","title":"Linux klogd 格式化字符串本地提权漏洞","description":"Linux系统内核日志守护进程klogd存在安全漏洞，该进程无法正确清理用户输入的格式字符串。当攻击者触发异常的内核消息时，可以利用此漏洞在本地提权，获得root权限。该漏洞影响多种Linux厂商的klogd服务，攻击者无需远程身份认证即可通过引发特定的内核消息来执行任意代码，严重威胁系统安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0867"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:38.097","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核及 klogd 到修复版本：Red Hat 6.2/7.0 升级至 klogd-1.4.1-5 或更高版本，Debian 2.2 升级至 klogd_1.4.1-5.1 或更高，SuSE 6.4/7.0 升级至 klogd-1.4.1-31 或更高，Mandrake 7.1/7.2 升级至 klogd-1.4.1-2.1 或更高。临时缓解措施：限制 klogd 权限运行（使用 -u 参数指定非 root 用户），或在 /etc/syslog.conf 中限制内核日志权限，禁止普通用户触发内核消息生成。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0193.html","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:050","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97726239017741&w=2","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv9_draht_syslogd_txt.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5824","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-061.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-September/000023.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5259","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0867.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0867.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0867","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0867.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0867.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-6723-fv38-7gcj/GHSA-6723-fv38-7gcj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-050.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--25f075df-bbe9-494d-abf2-8bd61b01f141.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0899.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0648","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0648.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0883","title":"Mandrake Linux mod_perl /perl 目录浏览漏洞","description":"Mandrake Linux 6.1 至 7.1 版本中，Apache 的 mod_perl 模块默认配置将 /perl/ 目录设置为可浏览，导致远程攻击者可直接列出该目录内容，造成信息泄露。该漏洞源于 mod_perl 默认配置未限制目录浏览权限，攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 请求访问 /perl/ 目录获取敏感文件列表。影响 Mandrake Linux 6.1、7.0、7.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需认证，仅影响机密性。攻击者可直接通过浏览器或工具访问 /perl/ 目录获取文件列表，可能泄露敏感脚本源码或配置信息。Mandrake 已发布补丁修复该配置缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0883"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.130","remediation":"升级到至少包含安全修复的 Mandrake Linux 7.2 或更高版本，并编辑/mod_perl/conf文件或 Apache httpd.conf，添加`Options -Indexes`配置以禁用/perl/目录的目录浏览功能。如无法立即升级，可在Apache配置文件中添加`AllowOverride All`并指定`<Directory /perl>`路径，限制访问权限到特定IP地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0111.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1678","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5257","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0883.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0883","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0883.md","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2000-0883.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0883.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/perl_browseable.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0883.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0883.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0648.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0648.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0648.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0647","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0647.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0881","title":"LPPlus LPPlus 3.2.2/3.3 dccscan 未授权文件读取漏洞","description":"tags.<value>LPPlus 3.2.2 和 3.3 版本的 dccscan setuid 程序存在权限检查缺陷，未正确验证调用用户是否拥有打印指定文件的权限。本地攻击者无需身份认证即可通过指定任意文件路径给 dccscan，利用其 setuid 特权读取并打印系统敏感文件，造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响 LPPlus 3.2.2 及 3.3 版本，攻击条件为本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0881"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.873","remediation":"移除 LPPlus 打印系统中 dccscan 程序的 setuid 权限位，执行命令 chmod u-s $LPHOME/bin/dccscan 使该程序以普通用户权限运行，阻止root级别文件访问。立即升级至现代打印服务系统如 CUPS，彻底取代已停止维护的 LPPlus 版本。如短期内无法迁移系统，应在 /etc/passwd 和 /etc/group 中限制 dccscan 可被执行用户的范围，仅允许授权的打印操作组使用该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0531.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1644","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5201","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0881.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0881","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0881.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0881.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mhr6-m9pw-wprq/GHSA-mhr6-m9pw-wprq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0881.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0881.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0647.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0646","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0646.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0880","title":"LPPlus 权限拒绝服务漏洞","description":"LPPlus 3.2.2/3.3 版本存在权限配置缺陷，其创建的 lpdprocess 文件具有全局可写权限。本地攻击者可利用该缺陷向文件写入任意进程 ID，随后调用具有 setuid 权限的 dcclpdshut 程序终止指定进程，导致任意进程被终止的拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 LPPlus 3.2.2 和 3.3 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限且能写入 lpdprocess 文件，利用方式为写入目标进程 PID 后触发 setuid 程序终止该进程，CVSS 评分 3.6（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:P），属本地权限提升类拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0880"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.750","remediation":"建议升级至 LPPlus 3.3.1 或更高版本（厂商已修复该权限问题）。若无法升级，请立即执行以下缓解措施：1) 修改 lpdprocess 文件权限为 644（chmod 644 /var/spool/lpd/lpdprocess），移除全局写权限；2) 移除 dcclpdshut 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/dcclpdshut）；3) 限制本地用户对打印队列目录的访问权限。建议联系厂商获取官方补丁包 LPPlus-3.3.1-patch.tar.gz 进行正式修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0531.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1643","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5200","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20192","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0880.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2